WEBVTT

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:05.302
How to <b>sell on credit</b>: your customer takes it today and pays later

00:00:05.353 --> 00:00:26.224
Build the sale as usual

00:00:26.348 --> 00:00:29.098
Choose <b>Crédito</b> (credit) and who you are selling to

00:00:29.152 --> 00:00:33.609
Find your customer by name or phone

00:00:33.663 --> 00:00:38.413
If they leave a <b>down payment</b>, enter it: MiCaja shows how much is left on credit

00:00:38.462 --> 00:00:43.478
Selling on credit asks for the <b>administrator's PIN</b>

00:00:43.527 --> 00:00:50.918
Done: the debt is under your customer's name, and you collect it when they come back
